t-media\" href=\"https://x.com/MateoPCTech/status/2096698644460110005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hdpQ-GmqSig/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"270\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"x-post-body\">\n        <p class=\"x-post-text\">New vid <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hdpQ-GmqSig&amp;t=4s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hdpQ-GmqSig&amp;t=4s</a></p>\n        <p class=\"x-post-meta\"><a href=\"https://x.com/MateoPCTech/status/2096698644460110005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@MateoPCTech · Sep 6, 2026</a></p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"x-follow\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://x.com/MateoPCTech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Follow @MateoPCTech</a></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>YouTube Channel</h3>\n    <p>Overclocking guides, BIOS tutorials, and benchmarks. 20+ videos covering Intel 14th gen, Arrow Lake, X3D chips, DDR4/DDR5 tuning, and more. Plus a second channel, Mateo Benchmarking, dedicated to raw game benchmark runs.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MateoPcTech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Subscribe on YouTube</a>\n    <a class=\"btn grey\" href=\"/youtube\">Watch Videos</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>Roch Tools</h3>\n    <p>Free Windows tools from Roch Studio. Start with <strong>Roch Viewer</strong> (timings) and <strong>Roch CPU</strong> (Intel + AMD tuning), plus GPU, NVRAM, and Stress Test.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/roch-tools\">Download tools</a>\n    <a class=\"btn grey\" href=\"https://github.com/RochStudio\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>Skool Community</h3>\n    <p>Tired of crashes and &quot;stable&quot; overclocks that fall apart mid-game? Get more FPS, cooler temps, and real stability — with step-by-step guides, weekly live calls, and daily support from Mateo. <strong>$20/month.</strong></p>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.skool.com/mateo-tech-5956/about\" target=\"_blank\">Join on Skool</a>\n    <a class=\"btn grey\" href=\"/skool\">Learn More</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>Discord</h3>\n    <p>Hang out with other PC builders, talk overclocking and benchmarks, and get help with your build.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/discord\">Learn More</a>\n    <a class=\"btn grey\" href=\"https://discord.gg/hPze8rTxqJ\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Discord</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>Recommended Parts</h3>\n    <p>The parts I recommend for building and overclocking.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/parts\">See the List</a>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <p>Mateo PC Tech &middot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MateoPcTech\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MateoBenchmarking\" target=\"_blank\">Benchmarking Channel</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://x.com/MateoPCTech\" target=\"_blank\">X (Twitter)</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hPze8rTxqJ\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://github.com/RochStudio\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.skool.com/mateo-tech-5956/about\" target=\"_blank\">Skool</a></p>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
